# What never belongs in the image.
#
# `data/` and `workspace/` hold the OPERATOR'S state — provider API keys, chat
# history, generated files. Copying them into an image would bake secrets into a
# layer that gets pushed to a registry and pulled onto a host.
node_modules
data
workspace
.smoke
.git
.gitignore

# Editor and agent scratch that has nothing to do with running the server.
.claude
.kilo
.vscode
*.log
*.tmp
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
